title={Molecular characterization, cellular localization and light-dependent expression of dinoflagellate vacuolar-type H<SUP>+</SUP>-ATPase (VHA) subunit B in the colourful outer mantle of the giant clam, Tridacna squamosa, indicate the involvement of VHA in CO<sub>2</sub> uptake in the photosynthesizing symbionts},
